1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,930
If every drop of water

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:03,480
on Earth vanished,

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,270
you wouldn't survive it.

4
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,560
Up to sixty percent

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,330
of an adult's body is water,

6
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:11,020
so every person, animal and plant

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,840
would instantly shrivel.

8
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:15,110
The oceans would leave basins

9
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:15,770
averaging about

10
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:18,280
three point seven kilometers deep.

11
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,950
Clouds would disappear.

12
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:21,135
And water vapor is

13
00:00:21,175 --> 00:00:22,920
Earth's biggest heat trapper,

14
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:25,010
about half the greenhouse effect.

15
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,535
Without it, far more heat

16
00:00:26,575 --> 00:00:28,680
would escape into space every night,

17
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,550
like a desert everywhere.

18
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:32,150
Here's the strange part.

19
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:33,700
Rolled into one ball,

20
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:34,770
all that water would be

21
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:38,090
under 1,400 kilometers wide.

22
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,915
A planet nine times wider

23
00:00:39,955 --> 00:00:41,180
depends on it.

24
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,200
Subscribe so you

25
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:44,770
never miss the next what-if.
